  "title": "blf: Remove unnecessary NULL check",
  "description": "A NULL check isn't required before g_free. info_line has already\nbeen dereferenced before by wtap_buffer_append_epdu_string.\nAdd a (fairly obvious) ws_assert_not_reached for the default\ncase, which can't happen because this is a nested case.\n\nCoverity CID 1548059",
